# Silithus, Felwood, Winterspring & the Plaguelands, Alliance ~57 to 60 (export visits 87-115, consensus Human).
# Flow: Ratchet -> Astranaar -> Felwood (Emerald Sanctuary, Shadow Hold twice, Irontree Woods and Arei, Felpaw
# Village, back to the Sanctuary) -> hearth Ratchet -> Gadgetzan (Aquementas, Broken Pillar) -> Un'Goro Crater
# (Slithering Scar, Fire Plume Ridge, Marshal's Refuge) -> Silithus (Cenarion Hold loop) -> Gadgetzan -> Talrendis
# Point and Forest Song -> Everlook, Ranshalla, the Shardtooth grind, Starfall Village, Donova Snowden -> Timbermaw
# Hold to Moonglade -> Auberdine and Rut'theran Village -> Darnassus -> the boat to Stormwind (bind, cloth, training)
# -> Ironforge (cloth, A Little Slime) -> Chillwind Camp -> Andorhal, Felstone Field, Northridge -> Terrordale grind
# to 60 -> Chillwind Camp -> hearth Stormwind and train (Shamans in Ironforge, by the Deeprun Tram).
# Forever's 30-60 content (Riverglades, Shen'dralas, Mount Hyjal, the rest of the Wetlands expansion) is not in
# the data yet: this guide follows Era + known Forever quests.
# Optional extras: Araj's Scarab and The Key to Scholomance (5803, 5505: Araj the Summoner is a level 61 elite);
# Of Forgotten Memories' turn-in (5781: optional in the previous guide, its Mercutio fight is elite); Runecloth for
# Meilosh (6031: thirty Runecloth); Dire Maul and Scholomance instead of the two long grinds.
# Deviations from the export (smooth-flow revision: one loop per hub, no long trips for one or two small quests):
# - The export bounces between Kalimdor and the Eastern Kingdoms five times. Kept order: Felwood, Tanaris and
#   Un'Goro, Silithus, then the northern Kalimdor turn-ins, the capitals and the Western Plaguelands last.
# - Merged: the second Tanaris and Un'Goro stops (export 93, 103, 104) into one pass Gadgetzan -> crater ->
#   Silithus, plus one Gadgetzan stop on the flight out of Silithus for Pawn Captures Queen; the Wetlands, Dun
#   Morogh and Duskwood cloth "objectives" are handed in from your bags (or the Auction House) at the Stormwind and
#   Ironforge stops; the second Ironforge and Darnassus stops (export 112, 113) into the first ones.
# - Winterspring before Moonglade (the Timbermaw tunnel joins them), and the Moonglade flight path is taken to fly
#   on to Auberdine (the export lists no flight out of Moonglade).
# - Dropped visits (long flights or boats for one or two small quests): Feralas (The Super Egg-O-Matic 2741,
#   Feathermoon Stronghold 7494), Burning Steppes (Yuka Screwspigot 4324, Return to Tinkee 4810, Mayara
#   Brightwing 4766), Searing Gorge (Dwarven Justice 3371, Release Them 3372), Duskwood (An Unfortunate End
#   99267), Azshara (Poisoned Water 6804, Stormers and Rumblers 6805) and the Eastern Plaguelands stop (export 92).
# - The Swamp of Sorrows / Blasted Lands chain and Loramus in Azshara (2681, 2702, 2701, 2721, 2743, 2744, 3141,
#   3508, 3509): The Stones That Bind Us is no longer accepted in the previous guide.
# - Stranglethorn Vale (export 115) is dropped: Avast Ye, Scallywag and Avast Ye, Admiral! (1036, 4621) need
#   Bloodsail Buccaneers standing and Baron Revilgaz in Booty Bay; Dressing the Part (9272) is the Pirates' Day
#   event; A Bijou for Zanza (8240) needs Zul'Gurub drops; Arena Master (7810) is the PvP arena chest.
# - The two grind stops (Rabid Shardtooth in Winterspring to 59, Terrordale Spirits in the Eastern Plaguelands to
#   60) replace the experience of the dropped quests; the export's own short grind (Restless Shades in Deadwind
#   Pass) went with Stranglethorn.
# - Hearths: Ratchet (from Felwood, as the export) and Cenarion Hold (inside Silithus). The Feathermoon,
#   Gadgetzan, Everlook and Craftsmen's Terrace binds are dropped (never hearthed to on this route); the Stormwind
#   bind is used for the last hearth after the grind instead of the Ironforge -> Stormwind hearth.
# Left out:
# - Fragments of the Past and its follow-ups (5247, 5248, 5252, 5253): not accepted in the previous guide (an
#   Enchanted Thorium Bar and Crystal Restores).
# - Of Lost Honor (5845), Tinkee Steamboil (4907), Ineptitude + Chemicals = Fun (1073) and the Darnassus cloth
#   quests (7792, 7798, 7799): the export never turns them in. An Old Colleague (1072) is not carried into this guide.
# - Toxic Horrors (5086): Donova offers it only after Mystery Goo (5085), at the Winterspring stop, but the Toxic
#   Horrors live in Felwood's Irontree Woods, which the route has already left. Doing it would mean riding back
#   through Timbermaw Hold to Irontree Woods and then returning to Donova.
# - Shards of the Felvine (5526: Dire Maul), Mother's Milk (4866: Mother Smolderweb in Blackrock Spire), The
#   Battle of Darrowshire and Hidden Treasures (5721, 5942: Redpath the Corrupted is an elite, Eastern
#   Plaguelands visit dropped).
# - Are We There, Yeti? (5163): Sprinkle and Legacki are scared in the previous guide; Quixxil is done here.
guide forever/alliance/50-60/06-silithus
title Silithus, Felwood, Winterspring & the Plaguelands
faction Alliance
levels 57-60
zone Silithus

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Felwood

step Astranaar
  zone The Barrens
  tip You start in Ratchet, where the previous guide hearthed you. Fly to Astranaar.
  sethome "Ratchet" npc 6791          -- Innkeeper Wiley: the last guide hearths you here, so this usually ticks at once
  fly "Astranaar"

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  zone Felwood
  tip Ride north out of Astranaar into Felwood to the druids' camp on the road just past the border.
  turnin 3942                         -- Eridan Bluewind
  accept 4084
  turnin 4441
  accept 4442
  turnin 4442                         -- Wait a moment for Eridan
  turnin 5159                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5165
  accept 5249                         -- Ivy Leafrunner: ends in Winterspring, keep it

step Shadow Hold braziers
  tip Shadow Hold is the cave at the back of Jaedenar, west of the road. Use the Purified Moonwell Water on the four braziers inside. Kill the Angerclaw bears and Felpaw wolves you pass for the Silvery Claws.
  interact 176158 quest 5165.1        -- Brazier of Pain
  interact 176161 quest 5165.4        -- Brazier of Hatred
  interact 176160 quest 5165.3        -- Brazier of Suffering
  interact 176159 quest 5165.2        -- Brazier of Malice
  collect 11172 quest 4084.1          -- Angerclaw bears and Felpaw wolves

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  turnin 5165                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5242

step A Final Blow
  tip Back into Shadow Hold: Moora and Salia guard Shadow Lord Fel'dan in its deepest chamber.
  kill 9861 quest 5242.1              -- Moora
  kill 9860 quest 5242.2              -- Salia
  collect 13207 quest 5242.3          -- Shadow Lord Fel'dan

step Irontree Woods
  tip Follow the road north to Irontree Woods. The Irontree Stompers carry the heart; finish the claws on the Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers of the north.
  collect 11173 quest 4084.2          -- Irontree Stompers
  collect 11172 quest 4084.1

step Arei
  tip Arei waits in Irontree Woods. Escort her out of the woods and keep her alive.
  accept 4261
  complete 4261

step Felpaw Village
  tip Ride north to the Deadwood furbolgs' village by the Timbermaw Hold cave mouth.
  turnin 5084 optional                -- Deadwood Cauldron, if you found the Firewater flask in Winterspring
  accept 5085 optional                -- Mystery Goo: Donova Snowden in Winterspring, keep it
  turnin 8471 optional                -- Kernda, just inside the cave: only from Neutral with the Timbermaw
  turnin 6031 optional                -- Meilosh, if you have thirty Runecloth

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  tip Ride back south along the road to the Sanctuary.
  turnin 4084                         -- Eridan Bluewind
  accept 4005                         -- Keep the Book of Aquor, the claws and the heart he hands back
  turnin 5242                         -- Greta Mosshoof

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tanaris and Un'Goro Crater

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  tip Hearth to Ratchet and fly to Gadgetzan. Buy two Thorium Bars at the Auction House here for Fire Plume Forged.
  hearth "Ratchet"
  fly "Gadgetzan"
  turnin 4504                         -- Tran'rek
  turnin 4496                         -- Alchemist Pestlezugg
  accept 4507

step Aquementas
  tip Ride east into the hills. Use the Book of Aquor to summon Aquementas, then defeat him for the totem.
  collect 11522 quest 4005.1

step Broken Pillar
  tip Ride south-west to Marvon Rivetseeker's camp at the Broken Pillar.
  turnin 3444

step The Slithering Scar
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Take the road west down into the crater and ride to the Slithering Scar, the silithid cave in the south. The Gorishi Hive Queen waits in its deepest chamber.
  collect 11835 quest 4507.1          -- Gorishi Hive Queen

step Fire Plume Ridge
  tip Climb Fire Plume Ridge in the middle of the crater and use the Skeleton Key Mold by the lava lake at the top, with two Thorium Bars in your bags. Fill Laris's Empty Pure Sample Jars on the Primal Oozes in the pools around the ridge.
  collect 14645 quest 5801.1 @48.9,47.0 -- Unfinished Skeleton Key
  collect 11954 quest 4513.1          -- Use the jars on slain oozes

step Marshal's Refuge
  tip Ride north to Marshal's Refuge. Use Umi's Mechanical Yeti beside Quixxil.
  kill 10977 quest 5163.3             -- Quixxil
  turnin 4005                         -- J.D. Collie
  accept 3961
  turnin 3961                         -- Linken, at the back of the refuge

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Silithus

step Into Silithus
  tip Ride west along the crater's northern wall to the pass in the north-west corner that climbs into Silithus.
  goto 29.0,22.0 "Toward the north-west pass"

step Cenarion Hold
  zone Silithus
  tip Follow the road south-west out of the pass to Cenarion Hold.
  sethome "Cenarion Hold"             -- Calandrath, the innkeeper
  turnin 8275                         -- Windcaller Proudhorn
  accept 8282                         -- Noggle Ficklespragg
  accept 8284                         -- Geologist Larksbane
  accept 8318                         -- Bor Wildmane
  accept 9415                         -- Rifleman Torrig, at the Alliance tents

step The Twilight Base Camp
  tip The Twilight's Hammer dig fills the north-west corner: tablet fragments lie on the ground and the Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers carry them too. Every cultist can drop an Encrypted Twilight Text: keep twenty, ten for Bor Wildmane and ten for Hermit Ortell later.
  collect 20378 quest 8284.1          -- Twilight Tablet Fragments
  collect 20404 quest 8318.1          -- Twilight's Hammer cultists
  collect 20404 x20 optional          -- Ten more for True Believers

step Hive'Zora
  tip Marshal Bluewall camps outside Hive'Zora, the western hive. Pick up a Silithyst at one of the red geysers nearby and carry it to the Alliance extractor at his camp.
  turnin 9415                         -- Marshal Bluewall
  accept 9419
  complete 9419
  turnin 9419

step Grind to 58
  tip Dredge Crushers roam the dunes between Hive'Zora and Cenarion Hold, on your way back. Commander Mar'alith only offers Dearest Natalia from level 58.
  level 58 -- grind on Dredge Crusher at the dunes east of Hive'Zora, Silithus

step Cenarion Hold
  turnin 8318                         -- Bor Wildmane
  turnin 8284                         -- Geologist Larksbane
  accept 8285
  accept 8304                         -- Commander Mar'alith

step Southwind Village
  tip Ride east to the ruins of Southwind Village. The Dusty Reliquary lies among the ruined buildings, watched by Tortured Sentinels.
  collect 22201 quest 5527.1          -- Dusty Reliquary

step Hermit Ortell
  tip The hermit hides among the rocks south-east of Southwind Village.
  turnin 8285
  accept 8279

step Bronzebeard's Encampment
  tip Ride south-west to the dwarves' camp near the southern mountains and question Frankal Stonebridge and Rutgar Glyphshaper. Noggle's satchel lies in the sand just south-east of the camp.
  kill 15171 quest 8304.1 "Talk to Frankal Stonebridge"
  kill 15170 quest 8304.2 "Talk to Rutgar Glyphshaper"
  collect 20379 quest 8282.1          -- Noggle's Satchel

step The Twilight Post
  tip Twilight Keeper Exeter holds the cultists' camp in the far south-west.
  collect 20395 quest 8279.2          -- Twilight Keeper Exeter

step Twilight Keeper Mayna
  tip Ride north along the west side to Mayna's small camp.
  collect 20394 quest 8279.1

step Twilight Keeper Havunth
  tip Havunth's camp sits just west of Cenarion Hold.
  collect 20396 quest 8279.3

step Cenarion Hold
  turnin 8304                         -- Commander Mar'alith
  turnin 8282                         -- Noggle Ficklespragg
  vendor nearest

step Hermit Ortell
  tip Ride back south-east to the hermit.
  turnin 8279
  accept 8287
  accept 8323                         -- Hand him the ten texts you kept
  turnin 8323

step Cenarion Hold
  hearth "Cenarion Hold"
  turnin 8287                         -- Commander Mar'alith

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Gadgetzan, Forest Song

step Gadgetzan
  zone Tanaris
  tip Fly to Gadgetzan.
  fly "Gadgetzan"
  turnin 4507                         -- Alchemist Pestlezugg
  accept 4508                         -- Gracina Spiritmight in Darnassus: keep it

step Forest Song
  zone Ashenvale
  tip Fly to Talrendis Point in Azshara and ride west along the road to Forest Song, just over the Ashenvale border.
  fly "Talrendis Point"
  turnin 4261                         -- Kayneth Stillwind

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Winterspring

step Everlook
  zone Winterspring
  tip Ride back to Talrendis Point and fly to Everlook.
  fly "Everlook"
  turnin 5163                         -- Umi Rumplesnicker

step Ranshalla
  tip Ride south to Owl Wing Thicket. Protect Ranshalla while she lights the torches on the way to the Altar of Elune.
  accept 4901
  complete 4901

step Dire Maul (optional)
  tip Running Dire Maul in Feralas instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. Skip this step to grind solo.
  note Dire Maul fits levels 55 to 60; the Rabid Shardtooth grind below gets you to 59 alone.

step Grind to 59
  tip The Rabid Shardtooth bears roam the snowy valley south of Owl Wing Thicket.
  level 59 -- grind on Rabid Shardtooth at the valley south of Owl Wing Thicket, Winterspring

step Starfall Village
  tip Ride back north to Everlook and west along the road to the night elf village.
  turnin 5249                         -- Wynd Nightchaser

step Donova Snowden
  tip Keep west on the road to Donova's camp beside the hot springs.
  turnin 5085 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Moonglade

step Umber
  zone Moonglade
  tip Take the Timbermaw Hold tunnel from its Winterspring mouth, west of Donova, and follow the Moonglade branch to Nighthaven. Umber studies by the lake shore.
  turnin 6844
  accept 6845

step Rabine Saturna
  tip Rabine Saturna's house stands in Nighthaven, east of Umber.
  turnin 5527
  turnin 6845

step Umber
  accept 1185
  turnin 1185

step Nighthaven
  tip Take the flight path in Nighthaven and fly to Auberdine.
  getfp "Moonglade"
  fly "Auberdine"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Teldrassil and Darnassus

step Rut'theran Village
  zone Teldrassil
  tip Take the boat from Auberdine to Rut'theran Village.
  turnin 4901                         -- Erelas Ambersky
  accept 4902

step Darnassus
  zone Darnassus
  tip Take the portal up to Darnassus.
  turnin 4508                         -- Gracina Spiritmight, in the Temple of the Moon
  accept 4510
  turnin 4510                         -- Idriana, in the bank
  turnin 4902                         -- Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm, atop the Cenarion Enclave

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stormwind and Ironforge

step Stormwind
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Go back down to Rut'theran Village, take the boat to Auberdine and the boat on to Stormwind Harbor. Bring sixty Silk, sixty Mageweave and sixty Runecloth for Clavicus: buy what you lack at the Auction House.
  sethome "Stormwind City"
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid
  collect 4306 x60 quest 7793.1 @61.2,71.3 live -- Silk Cloth
  collect 4338 x60 quest 7794.1 @61.2,71.3 live -- Mageweave Cloth
  turnin 7793                         -- Clavicus Knavingham, in the Trade District
  turnin 7794
  accept 7795
  collect 14047 x60 quest 7795.1 @61.2,71.3 live -- Runecloth
  turnin 7795

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  tip Take the Deeprun Tram to Ironforge. Bubulo Acerbus and Mistina Steelshield each want sixty Wool, sixty Silk and sixty Mageweave, then sixty Runecloth: 120 of each in all, from your bags or the Auction House.
  turnin 4513                         -- Laris Geardawdle
  train class only Shaman             -- Stormwind has no shaman trainer
  collect 2592 x60 quest 7807.1 @24.2,74.7 -- Wool Cloth
  collect 4306 x60 quest 7808.1 @24.2,74.7 -- Silk Cloth
  collect 4338 x60 quest 7809.1 @24.2,74.7 -- Mageweave Cloth
  turnin 7807                         -- Bubulo Acerbus
  turnin 7808
  turnin 7809
  accept 7811
  collect 14047 x60 quest 7811.1 @24.2,74.7 -- Runecloth
  turnin 7811
  collect 2592 x60 quest 7802.1 @24.2,74.7 -- Wool Cloth
  collect 4306 x60 quest 7803.1 @24.2,74.7 -- Silk Cloth
  collect 4338 x60 quest 7804.1 @24.2,74.7 -- Mageweave Cloth
  turnin 7802                         -- Mistina Steelshield
  turnin 7803
  turnin 7804
  accept 7805
  collect 14047 x60 quest 7805.1 @24.2,74.7 -- Runecloth
  turnin 7805

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Western Plaguelands

step Chillwind Camp
  zone Western Plaguelands
  fly "Chillwind Camp"
  turnin 5801                         -- Alchemist Arbington
  accept 5803 optional                -- Araj the Summoner is a level 61 elite
  turnin 6184                         -- Flint Shadowmore
  turnin 5903                         -- Nathaniel Dumah
  accept 5904

step Andorhal
  tip Chromie waits in the ruined inn on the west side of Andorhal, the ruined city north of the camp. Araj the Summoner guards his phylactery in the middle of the town.
  turnin 5941                         -- Chromie
  collect 14610 quest 5803.1 optional -- Araj is elite: grouping up is advised.

step Felstone Field
  tip Janice's ghost wanders by the farmhouse of Felstone Field, west of Andorhal. The Jabbering Ghouls in the field carry the other half of the charm: combine the two halves.
  turnin 5050
  accept 5051
  kill 10801 optional                 -- Jabbering Ghoul
  complete 5051
  turnin 5051

step Northridge Lumber Camp
  tip Ride north up the road to the lumber mill and set the termite barrel down in the middle of it.
  turnin 5904                         -- Termite Barrel
  accept 6389

step Tirion Fordring (optional)
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Tirion lives in a small hut on the border river, north-east of the lumber camp. Hand in Of Forgotten Memories if you finished it.
  turnin 5781 optional

step Scholomance (optional)
  tip Running Scholomance (Caer Darrow, south-east Western Plaguelands) or Stratholme instead of grinding gets you there faster in a group. Skip this step to grind solo.
  note Scholomance fits levels 58 to 60; The Key to Scholomance is handed in at Chillwind Camp below.

step Grind to 60
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Cross the river east of Tirion into Terrordale. The Terrordale Spirits haunt the woods there.
  level 60 -- grind on Terrordale Spirit at Terrordale, Eastern Plaguelands

step Chillwind Camp
  zone Western Plaguelands
  tip Ride back south-west to Chillwind Camp.
  turnin 6389                         -- Nathaniel Dumah
  turnin 5803 optional                -- Alchemist Arbington
  accept 5505 optional
  turnin 5505 optional

step Level 60
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Hearth to Stormwind and train your level 60 spells. This is the end of the leveling route: look at the reputation and dungeon guides next.
  hearth "Stormwind City"
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Mage,Warlock,Druid

step Shaman training
  only Shaman
  zone Ironforge
  tip Stormwind has no shaman trainer: take the Deeprun Tram from the Dwarven District to Ironforge and train your level 60 spells with Eldrun Stormbreaker.
  train class
